<title>JAPAN: Asahi Bank has loans of Y10.8 bln to Tokai Kogyo.</title>
<headline>Asahi Bank has loans of Y10.8 bln to Tokai Kogyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Bank Ltd said on Tuesday it has loans worth 10.8 billion yen to failed general contractor Tokai Kogyo Co Ltd, which it said may not be recoverable.</p>
<p>The top Japanese commercial bank said in a statement that the bank will carry out necessary procedures on the loans in the April to September period, but added that the action would not lead to any major change in its earnings outlook for the business year which started in April.</p>
</text>
